  "body": "Love the Devonport lifestyle but prefer your weekends without a renovation list?\r\n\r\n68A Ngataringa Road offers something refreshingly easy, a modern, beautifully presented family home where the hard work has already been done. Meticulously maintained by its owners, simply move in, spread out and enjoy.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* Four bedrooms, two bathrooms plus guest toilet\r\n* Multiple living spaces, giving the whole family room to spread out\r\n* Modern designer kitchen at the heart of the home\r\n* Fantastic indoor-outdoor flow to the peaceful, north-facing landscaped garden\r\n* Magnificent protected pohutukawa, attracting local birdlife and adding to the established garden setting\r\n* Heat pumps, underfloor heating in the bathrooms, plus European-designed double glazing manufactured to New Zealand standards\r\n* Solid bamboo flooring and beautifully maintained throughout\r\n* Flat, fully fenced section with automated gate, ideal for children and pets\r\n* Double internal-access garage plus excellent off-street parking\r\n\r\nThe layout has been designed with family life in mind, with multiple living areas providing flexibility for everyone to find their own space, while the main living areas connect effortlessly with the landscaped garden. It's a wonderfully calm setting for entertaining, family time or simply relaxing at home.\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Auckland's most sought-after coastal suburbs, you're within easy reach of Devonport Village, local beaches, parks, schools and ferry connections to the city.\r\n\r\nModern, beautifully maintained and ready to enjoy from day one. If you've been looking for the Devonport lifestyle without taking on someone else's renovation project, this could be exactly what you've been waiting for.\r\n\r\nAuction: Thursday 29 10 2026 (unless sold prior)\r\nLocation: Ray White Milford, in rooms 5:00pm\r\n\r\nrwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG34270",
